ambrosia: Congrats, you learned the bare minimum.
sabrina: Thanks…
ambrosia: I’m heading out. Please try to not blow up this restaurant. I don’t want a repeat of what happened to my last one.
sabrina: Your last restaurant? Is that why you’ve been so annoyed today?
ambrosia: Nonsense! Buildings are replaceable! It’s just that Marvey rejected my dinner proposal so now I need to go and drown my sorrows…
sabrina: Drama Queen.